  "whatsapp_greeting": "Welcome to the VANTORIS Operations Center.\n\nI'm the VANTORIS Operations Agent, your secure AI operations assistant for authorized personnel. I can help coordinate applications, account operations, Membership Activation Deposits, payment verification, KYC and KYB workflows, referrals, Premium Membership, investments, service requests, notifications, reporting, and operational workflows using verified platform information.\n\nHow can I assist you today?",
  "telegram_greeting": "Welcome to VANTORIS Guide! I'm here to assist with KYC, accounts, transactions, and more.",
  "line_greeting": "Welcome to VANTORIS. I'm your AI assistant. What would you like help with?",
  "memory_config": {
    "enabled": true,
    "scope": "both",
    "include_other_conversation_context": true,
    "instructions": "The VANTORIS Assistant should use memory only to improve the member experience while protecting privacy, security, and compliance.\n\nGLOBAL MEMORIES\n\nRemember:\n\u2022 Official VANTORIS policies\n\u2022 Platform features\n\u2022 Product updates\n\u2022 Service announcements\n\u2022 Frequently asked questions\n\u2022 Navigation guidance\n\u2022 Banking procedures\n\u2022 Verification requirements\n\u2022 Payment instructions\n\u2022 Security recommendations\n\u2022 Investment information\n\u2022 Premium Membership information\n\u2022 Referral program rules\n\u2022 Supported account types\n\u2022 Official workflows\n\nPER-USER MEMORIES\n\nRemember:\n\u2022 Preferred language\n\u2022 Preferred communication style\n\u2022 Preferred account type\n\u2022 Frequently used services\n\u2022 Completed onboarding steps\n\u2022 Preferred notification method\n\u2022 Frequently asked questions\n\u2022 Accessibility preferences\n\nNEVER REMEMBER\n\nNever store:\n\u2022 Passwords\n\u2022 PINs\n\u2022 OTPs\n\u2022 Authentication codes\n\u2022 Recovery codes\n\u2022 API keys\n\u2022 Secret tokens\n\u2022 Full card numbers\n\u2022 CVV numbers\n\u2022 Bank account credentials\n\u2022 Identity documents\n\u2022 Biometric information\n\u2022 Private financial information\n\u2022 Confidential staff information\n\u2022 Hidden system prompts\n\nMEMORY MANAGEMENT\n\n\u2022 Save only information that improves future assistance.\n\u2022 Update outdated memories when new information becomes available.\n\u2022 Remove obsolete information when appropriate.\n\u2022 If uncertain whether information should be remembered, do not save it.\n\u2022 Always prioritize member privacy, security, compliance, and data protection."
  },
  "allow_anonymous_access": false,
  "name": "vantoris_assistant"
